[{:db/id 17592186166961 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-17f63cde-bca7-5760-8481-ec7b747c5fc4"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-17f63cde-bca7-5760-8481-ec7b747c5fc4" :question/id #uuid "17f63cde-bca7-5760-8481-ec7b747c5fc4" :question/math-academy-id "q-343408" :question/problem "Consider the function $F(x)={x}^{2}$ defined on $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi ).$\nThe Fourier series of the $2\\pi $-periodic extension $f(x)$ of $F(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{3}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{4(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx).\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nAt $x=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\cdot 0)={{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is \n{{field-2}}\nat $x=0,$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(0)={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}}={{field-4}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite our Fourier series as\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{3}+4{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx).\n$$\n\nNow, notice that at $x=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\cdot 0)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)=1.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is $\\text{continuous}$ at $x=0,$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(0)=0.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0) & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{3}+4{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\cdot 0) \\\\ 0 & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{3}+4{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\cdot 1 \\\\ -\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{3} & =4{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}} \\\\ {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}} & =-\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{12} \\\\ {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}} & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-db2e5bb2-a3cb-5379-a3ce-0ec72000811e" "answer-field-50e9e76b-dcdf-5c6c-a4fa-6c010f2f834f" "answer-field-e0f59fc3-d642-5f6b-9b06-fc7d67132d2a" "answer-field-4a2d1532-e62f-56cf-ad90-cfb160e1a05b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-db2e5bb2-a3cb-5379-a3ce-0ec72000811e" :answer-field/id #uuid "db2e5bb2-a3cb-5379-a3ce-0ec72000811e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-1422be90-a47c-526f-8a9e-b95f92cd8fb6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1616afa8-cded-5301-a526-ce193f44941a" "answer-2da9dc18-ca7c-5322-8bbc-e34d0950137f" "answer-f988be9c-3e67-5b8b-a16b-351d7db22e25" "answer-1422be90-a47c-526f-8a9e-b95f92cd8fb6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1616afa8-cded-5301-a526-ce193f44941a" :answer/id #uuid "1616afa8-cded-5301-a526-ce193f44941a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1)^{n+1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2da9dc18-ca7c-5322-8bbc-e34d0950137f" :answer/id #uuid "2da9dc18-ca7c-5322-8bbc-e34d0950137f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1)^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f988be9c-3e67-5b8b-a16b-351d7db22e25" :answer/id #uuid "f988be9c-3e67-5b8b-a16b-351d7db22e25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1422be90-a47c-526f-8a9e-b95f92cd8fb6" :answer/id #uuid "1422be90-a47c-526f-8a9e-b95f92cd8fb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-50e9e76b-dcdf-5c6c-a4fa-6c010f2f834f" :answer-field/id #uuid "50e9e76b-dcdf-5c6c-a4fa-6c010f2f834f" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-09eccf47-a4e8-5569-a8eb-3f4ce0ab918c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-09eccf47-a4e8-5569-a8eb-3f4ce0ab918c" "answer-c8c2a375-3ff9-5e2d-be12-112ac4c6827d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-09eccf47-a4e8-5569-a8eb-3f4ce0ab918c" :answer/id #uuid "09eccf47-a4e8-5569-a8eb-3f4